    "sections": {
        "description": "NewsMemo is a responsive WordPress theme for news and magazine-style websites. It provides a clean layout focused on readability and structured content presentation. The theme includes basic customization options, custom widgets, and support for multiple post formats such as articles, images, videos, and galleries. It is designed to perform efficiently and adapt to different screen sizes, ensuring consistent display across desktop and mobile devices."
